40
00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:19.755
Malis visits her uncle's rice farm. First, the farmer uses a plough to dig the rice field. Then they plant small rice seedlings in the water. A scarecrow keeps the birds away. At the end, they cut the rice with a sickle and carry the hay on an ox cart.

